### META
directory_path: system/secrets
description: DINS secret storage - NEVER commit to git per GR-5
created: 2025-11-29
modified: 2025-11-29
status: active

### SECURITY (per GR-5 / DINS-PERSISTANT-RULES.md)
- Owner: root
- Group: dinssystem
- Directories: 770 (drwxrwx---)
- Files: 660 (rw-rw----)
- NEVER tracked in git
- Access mediated by DINS/DINSER only

### STRUCTURE
<service_name>.json | Per-service secrets
<service_name>/ | Per-service secret files (alternative)

### EXAMPLE_CONTENTS (not actual secrets)
tailscale_api.key | Tailscale API key
drnas_encryption.key | DRNAS encryption key

### ACCESS
Secrets are accessed via:
- dinser secrets helper functions
- Environment variable injection at deploy time
- Mounted volumes (ephemeral)

### GITIGNORE
This directory MUST be in .gitignore:
/system/secrets/*
!/system/secrets/.index
